@startuml
title 01 - System Context
autonumber

actor "Frontend / Postman" as FE
participant "API Gateway\n:8099" as GW
participant "GatewaySecurityFilter" as GSF
participant "Auth Service\n:8091" as AUTH
participant "Setting Service\n:8092" as SET
database "Auth DB" as ADB
database "Setting DB" as SDB
collections "SMTP" as SMTP

FE -> GW: HTTP requests
GW -> GSF: Validate JWT\nInject X-Company-Id

alt Route /api/v1/auth/**
  GW -> AUTH: Forward request
  AUTH -> ADB: Read/Write auth data
  AUTH -> SMTP: Send OTP emails
  ADB --> AUTH: Result
  AUTH --> GW: Response
else Route /api/v1/setting/**
  GW -> SET: Forward request
  SET -> SDB: Read/Write setting data
  SET --> GW: Response
end

GW --> FE: JSON response

note bottom
Core runtime path:
Frontend -> Gateway -> Service -> DB -> Gateway -> Frontend
end note

@enduml

